SUMMARY:New Light Trail—Hike
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\nThe New Light Trail is an 
 approximately 7.6 mile loop trail that has some hills\, rocks and roots. I
 t’s mostly used for mountain biking\, but during the week we’ll probab
 ly have it to ourselves. We can expect to see many birds and pretty lake v
 iews. Please wear something blaze orange or whatever you have that’s a b
 right color during hunting season. Also\, bring some water and a snack if 
 desired.\n\nBy participating in this event\, you agree to the terms below:
 \nTRIP PARTICIPANT WAIVER OF LIABILITY I fully realize that this activity 
 involves a risk of personal injury\, property damage\, or loss of my perso
 n or property. I hereby for myself\, my heirs\, executors and administrato
 rs\, and same for persons with whom are in my party\, waive and release an
 y claims or rights against Triangle Hiking & Outdoors Group (THOG)\, all o
 f its owners and coordinators for any and all injury\, damages or loss to 
 my person or property incurred during this activity. I also understand tha
 t THOG organizers are not required\, nor should it be assumed that they ar
 e CPR/First Aid/Wilderness Survival Certified and I am responsible for my 
 own personal safety.
